1
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,840
♪ I've never believed in love ♪

2
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:17,320
♪ I've never trusted anyone ♪

3
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,040
♪ I've always lived by reason ♪

4
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:24,280
♪ I've never followed my heart ♪

5
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:27,560
♪ Locked away with a complicated code ♪

6
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:31,960
♪ But you broke through
my heavily guarded firewall ♪

7
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:36,240
♪ That used to protect my heart ♪

8
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:40,800
♪ I'm in love with you ♪

9
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,640
♪ I've just realized today that love ♪

10
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:50,560
♪ Is something I should get to know and explore ♪

11
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:53,920
♪ The code to my heart has been cracked ♪

12
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
♪ By the love you wrapped me in ♪

13
00:00:58,080 --> 00:01:00,680
♪ Having you close puts you in my dreams ♪

14
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:02,240
♪ You're always on my mind ♪

15
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:04,640
♪ You cracked my code ♪

16
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:08,040
♪ My heart's security system is disabled ♪

17
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:11,240
♪ You unlocked my heart with a love ♪

18
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:15,880
♪ That this world has never given me ♪

19
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:18,680
♪ Can I write a new code ♪

20
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:21,240
♪ That says I love you? ♪

21
00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:25,120
♪ Love you ♪

22
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,560
You have to win me over first.

23
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:36,800
How will I know if I've won you over?

24
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:38,840
You have to earn 100 points.

25
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,280
Only then do you get to date me.

26
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:41,720
How did you know what I like to eat?

27
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:44,280
I've always known.
I just never did anything about it.

28
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,160
Now I see that you love me.

29
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:59,640
You make me want to wake up every day
as your boyfriend.

30
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:02,400
(I have a boyfriend now)

31
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,400
I like men.

32
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,280
I love Nont.

33
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:07,320
I want you to continue your studies
for two or three more years.

34
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:10,400
I want Nont to live his life
the way he wants to.

35
00:02:10,479 --> 00:02:12,960
Not just wasting it waiting for someone.

36
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,000
What's going on?

37
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,680
Is my boss a bad boyfriend or something?

38
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,800
You just became his boyfriend,

39
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:56,120
and now you're running away from him?

40
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:57,280
It's the opposite.

41
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,280
Kit's a good boyfriend.

42
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:01,720
He's great, even.

43
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,320
He's so great that…

44
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:05,880
I had to leave.

45
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,000
What do you mean?

46
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,880
Remember when you first
got obsessed with green tea?

47
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:13,680
You'd get up at 5:30 every morning

48
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:17,080
to boil water and brew it

49
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:19,440
to get those antioxidants.

50
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,960
How's that going now?

51
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,200
I'm so over it.

52
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:25,720
Kit's the same.

53
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,840
He's only just getting to know himself,

54
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,720
so everything is new to him.

55
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:32,560
So you think…

56
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,640
he might just be infatuated with you?

57
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,600
It's not only about me.

58
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:39,880
It's about what he likes too.

59
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:42,480
I figured if I leave him on his own,

60
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,720
he'll actually learn from it.

61
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:46,600
If I'm always there for him,

62
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:50,440
he might never learn by himself.

63
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,120
Aren't you overthinking it?

64
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:54,560
Listen to me.

65
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:55,680
Yeah?

66
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:58,080
I want him by my side for the rest of my life,

67
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:01,080
in whatever role.

68
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,320
I can't afford to think less.

69
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:26,160
I used to think

70
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,480
the hardest part about my love life

71
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:31,240
would be waiting for Kit to get to know himself.

72
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:32,840
But I was wrong.

73
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,960
The hardest part

74
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:38,520
wasn't when he didn't realize who he was.

75
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:40,720
It wasn't when he rejected me.

76
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:43,000
It wasn't when he pushed me away.

77
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,480
The hardest part

78
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,160
is now,

79
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,640
when everything is finally normal.

80
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,680
Because when I had to fight,

81
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:56,120
I knew what I had to do.

82
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,720
Now that there's nothing left to fight for,

83
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,360
I don't know what to do.

84
00:05:02,840 --> 00:05:05,520
There's just Kit,
sitting there eating what he loves,

85
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,160
and me, sitting beside him.

86
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,640
Mama Wan is on her way.

87
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,200
It's her birthday today.

88
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:23,000
Please behave, okay?

89
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,600
That depends on her.

90
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,080
How about this?

91
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:32,000
If you can't take it and need help,

92
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:34,400
send me a code and I'll come help.

93
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:36,280
A code? What code?

94
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:38,800
Just cross your arms.

95
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:41,280
Kit!

96
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,920
Hello, Mama Wan.

97
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,880
Hello, dear.

98
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:53,480
Happy birthday.

99
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:55,400
Thank you so much.

100
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,240
I hope you stay healthy,

101
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:59,600
beautiful, rich, and brilliant forever.

102
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:02,720
Oh, my dear boy, you're the sweetest!

103
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:08,160
Happy birthday.

104
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,480
Still better than nothing.

105
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,800
Mama Wan, let's go eat.

106
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:16,000
I made lots of your favorite dishes.

107
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:17,600
You did?

108
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:18,600
Yeah. Let's go.

109
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:21,320
But before we eat,

110
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:24,160
there's something important
I want to talk about first.

111
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:27,600
Okay.

112
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,240
Use this for your tuition

113
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:32,160
and living expenses while you're studying.

114
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,160
It's all right, Mama Wan.

115
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:37,080
I have some savings,

116
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:40,120
and I was thinking of finding a part-time job.

117
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,480
Ten years ago,

118
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:47,840
I promised your parents

119
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,720
that I'd look after you the best I can.

120
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,480
Let me keep my promise, okay?

121
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,560
Thank you.

122
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:03,560
Study hard.

123
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,440
When you come back,

124
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,040
I'll hand the business over to you.

125
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:11,440
My other son isn't interested anyway.

126
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,760
It's not that.

127
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:17,560
I'm just not good at running a hotel.

128
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:19,560
Have you even tried?

129
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:21,240
How would you know you're not good at it?

130
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:28,080
Mama Wan, please let Kit be.

131
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:31,960
You can leave the hotel management to me.

132
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:34,800
Wonderful, dear.

133
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:37,560
Then study hard and come back quickly.

134
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,040
I'll be waiting.

135
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,480
Of course.

136
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,960
Because you're like this,

137
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,640
I want to make it on my own.

138
00:07:54,880 --> 00:07:57,520
So I never have to sit
and listen to your orders again.

139
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,640
Then prove it to me.

140
00:08:00,280 --> 00:08:01,560
Prove you're better than I am

141
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:03,480
and can run a business better than I can.

142
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:06,520
You do know

143
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,920
this wedding

144
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,600
is meant to protect you

145
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:14,360
from the consequences of your mistake, don't you?

146
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:15,880
Yes. I know.

147
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,280
And you both know

148
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:20,600
that our family

149
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:22,440
is only the three of us, right?

150
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:24,920
No matter what happens,

151
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:27,480
we will protect one another.

152
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:29,520
Kit,

153
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,760
now that Nont is your life partner,

154
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,200
you must love him,

155
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:38,400
look after him, and cherish him dearly.

156
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:41,120
In married life,

157
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,559
you have to take care of each other.

158
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:46,360
We only have each other.

159
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:49,400
Don't hurt one another's feelings.

160
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,560
No matter what happens,

161
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:58,360
I'll always be by both of your sides.

162
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,160
Thank you.

163
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:12,760
Kit, come sit next to me.

164
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:26,440
Do you know why I asked you to take care of Nont?

165
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,560
Because he has no one to look after him?

166
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,600
That's part of it.

167
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:38,960
But it was more because of my own fear.

168
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,840
What were you afraid of?

169
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:43,120
I was afraid

170
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,360
that if anything ever happened to me,

171
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,840
who would be with you?

172
00:09:58,280 --> 00:10:01,080
When I saw how much Nont loves you,

173
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:04,120
I felt at ease.

174
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:07,760
I know you two

175
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,680
would never abandon each other.

176
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,360
That's why

177
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,520
I let you keep loving Kit.

178
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:22,280
Why didn't you ever tell me

179
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:24,600
how Nont felt about me?

180
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,480
If I had told you,

181
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:30,160
you would have found a way to run from me anyway.

182
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:32,360
I know you too well.

183
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:36,040
So I'm the only one who didn't know myself.

184
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:38,680
I'll admit

185
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:47,400
it took me some time to accept your relationship,

186
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,920
especially

187
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:52,280
as a single mother.

188
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,240
Why is that?

189
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,560
Well,

190
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:57,800
I only have one son.

191
00:10:57,880 --> 00:11:01,640
I wanted to see you
get married and have grandchildren to hold.

192
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,160
But now

193
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,080
I

194
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:08,840
have two sons.

195
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,040
Mama Wan,

196
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:14,960
did I disappoint you?

197
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:16,400
Come on.

198
00:11:17,040 --> 00:11:18,560
Not at all, dear.

199
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,560
Don't think that way.

200
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:23,040
I

201
00:11:24,640 --> 00:11:26,120
have to love you

202
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,520
as you are,

203
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:31,880
not as

204
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,440
I wanted you to be.

205
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:38,680
And now

206
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,560
I feel so good

207
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:43,040
that you two love each other.

208
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:52,320
Thank you, Mama Wan,

209
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:54,280
for loving both of us.

210
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,000
Stop it.

211
00:12:24,400 --> 00:12:27,040
I need to book my university dorm room first.

212
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,160
Do it tomorrow.

213
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,560
Let's do something else first.

214
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:38,000
Can't you wait until I finish?

215
00:12:40,880 --> 00:12:41,880
Kit!

216
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:44,320
Can't you wait for me to finish first?

217
00:12:45,760 --> 00:12:47,360
You're going away for years.

218
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:49,800
I don't want to waste even a single second.

219
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:55,280
Okay.

220
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:12,120
Then today I'll take care of you.

221
00:14:39,160 --> 00:14:42,160
Kit! Hurry up! I'm going to miss my flight!

222
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:43,400
Coming.

223
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,240
Where are you going?

224
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,120
To see you off.

225
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,720
What's the suitcase for then?

226
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:56,160
I'm not just seeing you off.

227
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:57,400
I'm going with you.

228
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,080
Really?

229
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:03,680
I'll stay with you for another week,

230
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:05,120
so I can take you on trips

231
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:06,520
and treat you to some nice hotels.

232
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:09,400
Do you want me to come?

233
00:15:10,520 --> 00:15:12,200
Of course I do!

234
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:16,040
That's good.

235
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,760
It'll be

236
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:22,000
a nice change of scenery,
and we can enjoy some good food.

237
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:25,520
Let's go.

238
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:30,280
But where will you be staying?

239
00:15:36,920 --> 00:15:38,400
Isn't that…

240
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:40,200
A car…

241
00:15:44,160 --> 00:15:45,880
I thought I'd miss you two.

242
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:47,840
Mom, why are you here?

243
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:50,080
I'm coming to see Nont off too.

244
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:56,560
Dee, put my bags in Kit's car.

245
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:00,600
Are you planning to stay for months?

246
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:02,120
Oh, come on.

247
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:04,520
I have to go check Nont's dorm, don't I?

248
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:07,680
I need to see if it's clean, cozy,
convenient, and safe.

249
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:10,520
Why didn't you tell me you were coming?

250
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:12,840
If I had told you,

251
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:14,200
you wouldn't have let me go.

252
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:20,200
Hurry up! We don't want to miss the flight.

253
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:28,840
It's okay, Kit.

254
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:33,240
I know you'll find a way

255
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:35,760
to take me out for some good food.

256
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:40,880
Please take care of them.

257
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:56,120
(One month later)

258
00:17:12,839 --> 00:17:14,200
Why aren't you asleep yet?

259
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:15,880
I just started my company.

260
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,240
There's a lot to do.

261
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:20,599
You say that every night.

262
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:22,560
And I mean it every night.

263
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:25,560
Have you eaten dinner yet?

264
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:26,960
Yes.

265
00:17:28,079 --> 00:17:29,160
What did you eat?

266
00:17:29,760 --> 00:17:30,680
Uh…

267
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:31,840
A protein bar.

268
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:33,160
I knew it!

269
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:35,720
Mama Wan keeps calling me.

270
00:17:35,800 --> 00:17:38,680
She says you work late and barely eat.

271
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:41,840
You always leave the food
she puts in your fridge uneaten.

272
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,360
So,

273
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:45,400
she told you to check up on me.

274
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:47,320
You didn't call because you wanted to.

275
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,040
Don't change the subject.

276
00:17:50,040 --> 00:17:51,680
Okay, okay, I give up.

277
00:17:52,280 --> 00:17:55,000
I'll eat properly and take better care of myself.

278
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:57,760
Good!

279
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:00,920
That's more like it.

280
00:18:01,600 --> 00:18:03,560
What about you? How are you doing?

281
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,080
I'm good.

282
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:06,520
Just finished my exams.

283
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:08,600
Did you pass?

284
00:18:09,520 --> 00:18:10,840
Of course I passed!

285
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:17,400
I miss you.

286
00:18:20,280 --> 00:18:21,240
I...

287
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:23,800
miss you too.

288
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:28,880
I really want to see you now.

289
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:33,040
I want to see you too.

290
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:34,880
Can you wait for me?

291
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:37,480
I have no choice, do I?

292
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:38,720
Starting tomorrow,

293
00:18:38,800 --> 00:18:40,440
you have to take better care of yourself.

294
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:42,760
Eat something and send me a photo too.

295
00:18:43,400 --> 00:18:44,400
You got it.

296
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:46,800
I know it's getting cold over there.

297
00:18:47,120 --> 00:18:48,320
Take care of yourself, okay?

298
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,760
I will.

299
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:51,560
I'll be dreaming of you.

300
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:54,240
I'll be dreaming of you too.

301
00:18:55,520 --> 00:18:56,600
Bye-bye.

302
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:57,760
Bye!

303
00:18:57,840 --> 00:18:58,920
Good night.

304
00:19:00,120 --> 00:19:01,200
Bye-bye.

305
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:18,320
(Three months later)

306
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:38,680
♪ I've never believed in love ♪

307
00:19:38,760 --> 00:19:42,200
♪ I've never trusted anyone ♪

308
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:44,880
♪ I've always lived by reason ♪

309
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:49,080
♪ I've never followed my heart ♪

310
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:52,400
♪ Locked away with a complicated code ♪

311
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:56,760
♪ But you broke through
my heavily guarded firewall ♪

312
00:19:56,840 --> 00:20:01,240
♪ That used to protect my heart ♪

313
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:05,840
♪ I'm in love with you ♪

314
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:09,480
♪ I've just realized today that love ♪

315
00:20:09,560 --> 00:20:15,440
♪ Is something I should get to know and explore ♪

316
00:20:15,520 --> 00:20:18,960
♪ The code to my heart has been cracked ♪

317
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:22,800
♪ By the love you wrapped me in ♪

318
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:25,600
♪ Having you close puts you in my dreams ♪

319
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:26,920
♪ You're always on my mind ♪

320
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:29,680
♪ You cracked my code ♪

321
00:20:29,760 --> 00:20:32,840
♪ My heart's security system is disabled ♪

322
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:36,080
♪ You unlocked my heart with a love ♪

323
00:20:36,160 --> 00:20:40,880
♪ That this world has never given me ♪

324
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:43,320
♪ Can I write a new code ♪

325
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:46,480
♪ That says I love you? ♪

326
00:20:51,800 --> 00:20:54,800
♪ Locked away with a complicated code ♪

327
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:59,360
♪ But you broke through
my heavily guarded firewall ♪

328
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:03,600
♪ That used to protect my heart ♪

329
00:21:04,280 --> 00:21:06,440
I started cooking after Nont left,

330
00:21:07,840 --> 00:21:09,600
and it made me realize

331
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:11,880
that cooking is a way of saying

332
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:13,200
"I love you."

333
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:15,920
Because what matters in cooking

334
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:17,560
is the care you put into it.

335
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:20,960
♪ The code to my heart has been cracked ♪

336
00:21:21,040 --> 00:21:24,960
♪ By the love you wrapped me in ♪

337
00:21:25,040 --> 00:21:27,720
♪ Having you close puts you in my dreams ♪

338
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:29,120
♪ You're always on my mind ♪

339
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:31,680
♪ You cracked my code ♪

340
00:21:31,760 --> 00:21:34,960
♪ My heart's security system is disabled ♪

341
00:21:35,040 --> 00:21:38,120
♪ You unlocked my heart with a love ♪

342
00:21:38,200 --> 00:21:42,760
♪ That this world has never given me ♪

343
00:21:42,840 --> 00:21:43,680
♪ Can I write a new code ♪

344
00:21:43,760 --> 00:21:45,040
When I first got here,

345
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:47,120
I called Kit every night.

346
00:21:47,800 --> 00:21:49,760
I was afraid I'd forget his voice.

347
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:52,080
But one day,

348
00:21:52,560 --> 00:21:54,080
I realized there was nothing to be afraid of.

349
00:21:54,160 --> 00:21:55,880
Kit was never going anywhere.

350
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:12,360
Mr. Roch is here to see you.

351
00:22:20,920 --> 00:22:22,520
Feeling lonely without your boyfriend?

352
00:22:23,280 --> 00:22:24,520
Please have a seat.

353
00:22:31,840 --> 00:22:33,120
I have something to tell you.

354
00:22:33,760 --> 00:22:36,440
If it's about you partnering with Mr. Pat,

355
00:22:36,800 --> 00:22:37,880
I already know.

356
00:22:38,440 --> 00:22:39,480
News travels fast.

357
00:22:40,760 --> 00:22:42,800
Any suggestions?

358
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:44,120
Maybe an offer?

359
00:22:44,880 --> 00:22:47,040
The deal is subject to change, you know.

360
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:54,560
No.

361
00:22:55,320 --> 00:22:56,960
In fact, I was just about to tell you.

362
00:22:59,760 --> 00:23:01,880
I've decided to step back.

363
00:23:02,960 --> 00:23:03,880
Step back?

364
00:23:04,280 --> 00:23:05,400
Yes.

365
00:23:05,800 --> 00:23:07,000
I've talked with Nu.

366
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:09,480
If you want the CEO position,

367
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:11,440
I won't stand in your way.

368
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:13,800
I'll sell you all my shares,

369
00:23:15,600 --> 00:23:17,000
but I expect a fair price.

370
00:23:17,960 --> 00:23:19,040
Do you even realize

371
00:23:19,600 --> 00:23:20,600
what you're saying?

372
00:23:21,080 --> 00:23:22,240
I do.

373
00:23:22,880 --> 00:23:23,960
I have savings.

374
00:23:24,520 --> 00:23:26,080
I'm going to start a new company.

375
00:23:26,440 --> 00:23:28,000
It may not be as big as NSL,

376
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:29,720
but it will be mine.

377
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:47,480
You've left me again, Kit.

378
00:23:48,640 --> 00:23:50,520
I'm choosing the path I'm comfortable with.

379
00:23:54,280 --> 00:23:56,000
Loving you hurt me so much

380
00:23:56,080 --> 00:23:58,080
that my heartbreak…

381
00:24:00,040 --> 00:24:01,520
eventually turned into anger.

382
00:24:04,840 --> 00:24:06,200
But I put up with it.

383
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:10,240
I thought

384
00:24:10,600 --> 00:24:11,840
it was because

385
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:13,080
you didn't know yourself yet.

386
00:24:15,080 --> 00:24:17,320
But today you know yourself.

387
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:21,640
Is there really no hope

388
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:23,520
you'd ever consider giving me a chance?

389
00:24:25,040 --> 00:24:26,160
Roch,

390
00:24:27,160 --> 00:24:29,440
I've always respected you as an older brother.

391
00:24:30,880 --> 00:24:31,920
Older brother?

392
00:24:35,880 --> 00:24:37,120
Fine. Older brother it is.

393
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:40,080
Thank you

394
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:42,200
for still considering me your older brother.

395
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:49,400
If there are any problems with the new company,

396
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:52,120
let me know.

397
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:54,000
Thank you.

398
00:24:57,240 --> 00:24:58,480
And…

399
00:24:59,960 --> 00:25:01,720
does your new company have a name yet?

400
00:25:02,560 --> 00:25:03,640
It does,

401
00:25:04,080 --> 00:25:05,680
but I'd keep it a secret for now.

402
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:37,800
Yes?

403
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:40,000
Hello, this is Mola Design.

404
00:25:40,760 --> 00:25:42,640
Mr. Kit, your work is finished.

405
00:25:43,440 --> 00:25:45,280
The company logo design?

406
00:25:46,840 --> 00:25:48,360
Please send it over right away.

407
00:26:00,800 --> 00:26:04,160
(One year later)

408
00:26:25,280 --> 00:26:26,440
Kit.

409
00:26:26,760 --> 00:26:27,880
Hey.

410
00:26:29,320 --> 00:26:30,680
It's been a year.

411
00:26:31,280 --> 00:26:32,320
I know.

412
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:33,960
Can you wait for me?

413
00:26:34,560 --> 00:26:35,800
I've waited a year already.

414
00:26:36,280 --> 00:26:37,560
Another year is nothing.

415
00:26:42,480 --> 00:26:43,640
Kit…

416
00:26:43,720 --> 00:26:44,680
Yes?

417
00:26:49,920 --> 00:26:51,080
What are you doing?

418
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:52,240
I…

419
00:26:53,080 --> 00:26:54,600
I want to give you a reward.

420
00:26:54,880 --> 00:26:55,920
A reward?

421
00:26:59,880 --> 00:27:01,360
What's going on right now?

422
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:02,880
Just watch.

423
00:27:03,320 --> 00:27:04,760
I want to reward you.

424
00:27:13,240 --> 00:27:14,960
Stop! You're embarrassing me!

425
00:27:15,880 --> 00:27:18,760
I just miss you.

426
00:27:24,040 --> 00:27:25,640
Do it with me.

427
00:27:49,240 --> 00:27:50,640
Try it too.

428
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:53,080
I'm doing it.

429
00:27:59,040 --> 00:28:01,920
Kit, imagine

430
00:28:02,840 --> 00:28:04,400
I'm kissing you.

431
00:28:07,560 --> 00:28:09,240
And then I slowly touch…

432
00:28:13,640 --> 00:28:14,800
your chest…

433
00:28:20,320 --> 00:28:22,120
trace down to your stomach…

434
00:28:30,240 --> 00:28:32,120
and then move further down.

435
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:36,840
Can you feel it?

436
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:39,160
I feel it.

437
00:28:41,640 --> 00:28:42,640
A lot?

438
00:28:44,560 --> 00:28:45,920
I miss you so much.

439
00:28:47,160 --> 00:28:48,520
I miss you too.

440
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:52,240
What do you want me to do?

441
00:28:53,600 --> 00:28:55,000
Just do what I do.

442
00:29:00,040 --> 00:29:01,360
I'm following you.

443
00:29:19,640 --> 00:29:21,160
I wish you were here.

444
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:25,960
I'm right here, aren't I?

445
00:29:27,800 --> 00:29:28,800
Kit.

446
00:29:29,840 --> 00:29:30,920
Nont…

447
00:29:32,040 --> 00:29:33,120
Kit.

448
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:37,040
Kit.

449
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:41,240
Kit.

450
00:29:41,760 --> 00:29:42,840
Nont.

451
00:29:50,320 --> 00:29:51,320
Kit.

452
00:29:58,040 --> 00:29:59,080
Kit.

453
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:00,960
Nont.

454
00:30:19,160 --> 00:30:20,280
What the--

455
00:30:21,120 --> 00:30:22,080
Kit?

456
00:30:22,160 --> 00:30:23,160
Kit?

457
00:30:23,560 --> 00:30:24,600
Kit?

458
00:30:26,680 --> 00:30:27,800
I'm back.

459
00:30:30,160 --> 00:30:31,320
What happened?

460
00:30:31,680 --> 00:30:33,280
I accidentally knocked my phone over.

461
00:30:38,760 --> 00:30:39,760
I love you.

462
00:30:41,120 --> 00:30:42,440
I love you too.

463
00:30:45,520 --> 00:30:47,040
I really want to see you in person.

464
00:30:47,520 --> 00:30:48,600
Go to bed now.

465
00:30:49,040 --> 00:30:50,560
When will I get to see you?

466
00:30:51,040 --> 00:30:52,280
Soon.

467
00:30:55,640 --> 00:30:56,760
Please go to bed.

468
00:30:58,120 --> 00:30:59,200
Good night.

469
00:30:59,680 --> 00:31:01,000
Good night.

470
00:31:03,600 --> 00:31:04,720
Bye-bye!

471
00:31:55,880 --> 00:31:56,680
Yes?

472
00:31:56,760 --> 00:31:57,880
What are you doing?

473
00:31:58,600 --> 00:31:59,800
Working at home.

474
00:32:00,240 --> 00:32:01,080
Perfect.

475
00:32:01,160 --> 00:32:02,680
Go open the front door.

476
00:32:03,280 --> 00:32:04,720
You've got a delivery.

477
00:32:04,800 --> 00:32:06,120
Just ask them to leave it outside.

478
00:32:06,200 --> 00:32:08,040
They can't. They need a signature.

479
00:32:08,480 --> 00:32:09,800
Go get it for me, okay?

480
00:32:10,240 --> 00:32:11,240
Okay, okay.

481
00:32:18,880 --> 00:32:19,880
Nont!

482
00:32:20,800 --> 00:32:22,920
Please sign for the package right here.

483
00:32:28,000 --> 00:32:28,960
Hey!

484
00:32:32,440 --> 00:32:33,720
Gotcha!

485
00:32:35,320 --> 00:32:36,360
Naughty.

486
00:32:43,560 --> 00:32:44,680
Let's go inside.

487
00:32:45,400 --> 00:32:46,480
Okay.

488
00:32:47,680 --> 00:32:48,920
I'll get that for you.

489
00:32:54,480 --> 00:32:55,840
Does Mom know about this?

490
00:32:55,920 --> 00:32:56,760
Of course.

491
00:32:56,840 --> 00:32:58,720
She helped me come up with this plan.

492
00:33:01,120 --> 00:33:02,280
She's something else.

493
00:33:14,440 --> 00:33:15,680
Kit.

494
00:33:15,760 --> 00:33:16,800
Yes?

495
00:33:16,880 --> 00:33:18,040
I'm hungry.

496
00:33:18,120 --> 00:33:19,120
What?

497
00:33:19,200 --> 00:33:20,280
I'm hungry.

498
00:33:20,360 --> 00:33:20,920
What?

499
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:22,320
I'm hungry!

500
00:33:22,400 --> 00:33:23,600
What did you say?

501
00:33:25,240 --> 00:33:27,000
I'm hungry!

502
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:28,600
Oh.

503
00:33:29,280 --> 00:33:30,440
Is there anything to eat?

504
00:33:30,520 --> 00:33:31,720
I'll go fix you something.

505
00:33:31,800 --> 00:33:33,120
It's fine, I'll make it myself.

506
00:33:33,200 --> 00:33:35,120
No need. I'll make you something.

507
00:33:35,440 --> 00:33:36,760
You've only just come back.

508
00:33:36,840 --> 00:33:39,160
I'll show you how well I've adapted.

509
00:33:41,200 --> 00:33:42,240
Okay.

510
00:33:42,320 --> 00:33:43,640
Then let me help you,

511
00:33:43,720 --> 00:33:45,680
just like we help each other with everything.

512
00:33:47,600 --> 00:33:48,360
Come on.

513
00:33:48,440 --> 00:33:49,520
Let's go.

514
00:34:12,120 --> 00:34:13,520
This is so good!

515
00:34:14,719 --> 00:34:15,840
I can't believe it.

516
00:34:16,280 --> 00:34:17,760
I've missed Thai food so much.

517
00:34:17,840 --> 00:34:19,000
There's none over there.

518
00:34:27,239 --> 00:34:28,840
So why did you come back, anyway?

519
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:31,000
It's the school break.

520
00:34:31,360 --> 00:34:33,199
I'll go back when it's over.

521
00:34:34,120 --> 00:34:35,480
You have to go back?

522
00:34:36,719 --> 00:34:37,679
Kit,

523
00:34:37,760 --> 00:34:39,440
I've only studied for a year.

524
00:34:39,520 --> 00:34:40,840
There's a year and a half left.

525
00:34:43,760 --> 00:34:46,639
You've handled the wait better than I expected.

526
00:34:47,280 --> 00:34:48,600
What can I do?

527
00:34:48,679 --> 00:34:50,239
My heart's already yours.

528
00:35:00,080 --> 00:35:02,360
So how have you been, being apart?

529
00:35:03,040 --> 00:35:03,960
Good.

530
00:35:04,280 --> 00:35:06,400
I learned that I can live on my own.

531
00:35:14,360 --> 00:35:17,000
But it would be better if you were with me.

532
00:35:21,080 --> 00:35:22,160
Same for me.

533
00:35:24,720 --> 00:35:25,800
Let's eat.

534
00:35:30,520 --> 00:35:32,120
Anything else you'd like to have?

535
00:35:32,520 --> 00:35:33,640
Like what?

536
00:36:28,360 --> 00:36:29,400
Kit.

537
00:36:29,480 --> 00:36:30,720
Again already?

538
00:36:32,640 --> 00:36:33,800
Are you up for it?

539
00:36:34,400 --> 00:36:35,480
Of course I am.

540
00:36:39,120 --> 00:36:40,480
It's my turn now.

541
00:37:53,400 --> 00:37:54,680
Want to go one more round?

542
00:37:57,720 --> 00:37:58,840
That's enough.

543
00:37:59,840 --> 00:38:01,240
-It's not enough.
-Huh?

544
00:38:01,320 --> 00:38:03,000
You're leaving for a whole year again.

545
00:38:05,160 --> 00:38:06,760
-Just one more round.
-No!

546
00:38:07,360 --> 00:38:09,440
-Just one more.
-No more.

547
00:38:09,520 --> 00:38:10,600
Nont.

548
00:38:10,680 --> 00:38:11,640
Come on!

549
00:38:11,720 --> 00:38:12,360
Kit!

550
00:38:12,440 --> 00:38:13,600
Nont!

551
00:38:18,720 --> 00:38:20,760
Have some pity on me, will you?

552
00:38:20,840 --> 00:38:22,680
It's a whole year, Nont.

553
00:38:24,360 --> 00:38:25,640
That's enough.

554
00:38:25,720 --> 00:38:27,640
-Why?
-I'm going to take a shower.

555
00:38:27,720 --> 00:38:29,320
Just one more round.

556
00:38:29,960 --> 00:38:31,120
Kit, stop it!

557
00:38:31,520 --> 00:38:32,520
I won't!

558
00:38:32,600 --> 00:38:33,520
Kit!

559
00:38:33,600 --> 00:38:35,080
You'll be away for a year.

560
00:38:35,480 --> 00:38:36,600
Hurry up.

561
00:38:36,920 --> 00:38:37,920
Kit!

562
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,280
Relax.

563
00:39:12,360 --> 00:39:14,800
We don't have to pretend
to be lovers all the time.

564
00:39:19,720 --> 00:39:21,720
So, we really have to live here?

565
00:39:40,800 --> 00:39:42,680
I like that you indulge me like this.

566
00:39:42,760 --> 00:39:43,840
It feels nice.

567
00:39:47,200 --> 00:39:48,960
My heart is pounding so hard right now.

568
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:51,320
I'll prove to you

569
00:39:52,960 --> 00:39:54,000
that I've grown up.

570
00:39:57,840 --> 00:39:59,040
I'm tired.

571
00:39:59,120 --> 00:40:00,280
Tired of what?

572
00:40:00,360 --> 00:40:01,640
Tired of guessing.

573
00:40:02,880 --> 00:40:04,280
Tired of watching for signs.

574
00:40:06,280 --> 00:40:08,760
Tired of you never telling me how you really feel.

575
00:40:10,480 --> 00:40:12,000
I waited for you to see me

576
00:40:13,920 --> 00:40:15,600
as more than just your little brother.

577
00:40:16,240 --> 00:40:17,400
To really see me.

578
00:40:17,960 --> 00:40:19,120
What are you talking about?

579
00:40:19,200 --> 00:40:20,760
I've loved you for ten years,

580
00:40:21,480 --> 00:40:22,840
and you never knew

581
00:40:22,920 --> 00:40:24,600
because you never looked at me!

582
00:40:24,680 --> 00:40:26,600
You chose everything except me!

583
00:40:26,680 --> 00:40:29,000
You never dared tell anyone what I mean to you!

584
00:40:29,080 --> 00:40:31,120
So what else am I supposed to wait for?

585
00:40:31,200 --> 00:40:33,720
I need someone who will stand beside me,

586
00:40:33,800 --> 00:40:35,800
not someone who will hide me!

587
00:40:41,000 --> 00:40:42,280
You're crying.

588
00:40:42,880 --> 00:40:44,440
I don't know what I'm feeling,

589
00:40:46,560 --> 00:40:47,640
but it hurts right here.

590
00:40:50,320 --> 00:40:52,160
It's hurt since the day you left.

591
00:40:57,320 --> 00:40:58,720
I miss you, Nont.

592
00:40:59,320 --> 00:41:00,640
I miss you too.

593
00:41:06,200 --> 00:41:07,920
I want you to remember me.

594
00:41:09,160 --> 00:41:10,400
Remember everything,

595
00:41:11,440 --> 00:41:12,600
remember the feeling,

596
00:41:13,440 --> 00:41:15,040
remember that I'm yours.

597
00:41:31,200 --> 00:41:32,280
I'm ready.

598
00:41:59,280 --> 00:42:00,480
Do you like it?

599
00:42:01,280 --> 00:42:02,920
I don't know if I like it…

600
00:42:05,280 --> 00:42:06,360
but I don't want it to end.

601
00:42:09,800 --> 00:42:11,000
Why are you smiling?

602
00:42:12,200 --> 00:42:13,440
I'm happy.

603
00:42:19,440 --> 00:42:20,640
What are you looking at?

604
00:42:25,760 --> 00:42:27,000
I feel like

605
00:42:27,520 --> 00:42:28,840
things are different

606
00:42:29,320 --> 00:42:30,520
between us now.

607
00:42:31,880 --> 00:42:32,880
How so?

608
00:42:33,400 --> 00:42:34,440
Before,

609
00:42:35,240 --> 00:42:36,840
I always had to watch you

610
00:42:37,560 --> 00:42:39,000
to see how you felt

611
00:42:39,440 --> 00:42:40,640
and what you needed.

612
00:42:43,160 --> 00:42:44,360
But now

613
00:42:47,080 --> 00:42:48,680
I don't have to do that at all.

614
00:42:51,200 --> 00:42:52,760
It's not that I love you any less.

615
00:42:53,360 --> 00:42:54,960
I just don't need

616
00:42:55,360 --> 00:42:57,280
to prove something to you anymore.

617
00:42:58,360 --> 00:43:00,200
You did things so that I'd notice.

618
00:43:01,080 --> 00:43:03,120
Now you do them because you want to.

619
00:43:06,840 --> 00:43:08,000
I've learned

620
00:43:08,280 --> 00:43:09,880
that when you love someone

621
00:43:10,800 --> 00:43:12,400
and do everything for them,

622
00:43:13,440 --> 00:43:15,360
they never learn to do things on their own.

623
00:43:19,120 --> 00:43:20,400
What about you, Kit?

624
00:43:20,840 --> 00:43:23,200
Does anything feel different to you?

625
00:43:24,720 --> 00:43:25,800
Yes.

626
00:43:27,400 --> 00:43:30,600
Has anyone ever asked you a simple question

627
00:43:30,680 --> 00:43:31,800
that you just couldn't answer?

628
00:43:31,880 --> 00:43:33,120
Why couldn't you answer?

629
00:43:33,640 --> 00:43:35,120
Because if I say it out loud,

630
00:43:35,720 --> 00:43:37,080
I'm afraid everything will change.

631
00:43:37,520 --> 00:43:38,720
I understand completely.

632
00:43:40,080 --> 00:43:41,120
So what do you do?

633
00:43:41,560 --> 00:43:43,400
You just have to practice.

634
00:43:43,880 --> 00:43:45,080
I like men!

635
00:43:45,720 --> 00:43:46,840
I love Nont!

636
00:43:47,920 --> 00:43:48,920
I love Nont!

637
00:43:50,440 --> 00:43:52,360
I don't want things to end up like last time.

638
00:43:54,320 --> 00:43:55,960
Nont, I need some time.

639
00:43:56,040 --> 00:43:57,680
You've always asked for time.

640
00:43:58,800 --> 00:44:00,760
My time has run out too.

641
00:44:02,960 --> 00:44:04,760
I've loved you for ten years,

642
00:44:05,320 --> 00:44:06,360
and you never knew

643
00:44:06,720 --> 00:44:08,600
because you never looked at me!

644
00:44:09,240 --> 00:44:10,720
It's impossible.

645
00:44:10,800 --> 00:44:12,120
Why is it impossible?

646
00:44:13,560 --> 00:44:14,840
Is it because we're men?

647
00:44:16,880 --> 00:44:18,280
Or you're just afraid?

648
00:44:21,840 --> 00:44:23,000
We're like brothers, Nont.

649
00:44:23,080 --> 00:44:24,760
We were never brothers.

650
00:44:29,680 --> 00:44:30,920
What have I done?

651
00:44:31,520 --> 00:44:33,800
Why did I let my fear hurt Nont,

652
00:44:34,280 --> 00:44:36,600
the only man who makes me happy?

653
00:44:38,840 --> 00:44:40,280
I want to be your boyfriend.

654
00:44:40,960 --> 00:44:42,040
You…

655
00:44:43,080 --> 00:44:44,920
really want to be my boyfriend?

656
00:44:45,720 --> 00:44:46,840
Yes.

657
00:44:47,320 --> 00:44:48,640
I want to be your boyfriend.

658
00:44:49,640 --> 00:44:51,200
I like it when you laugh.

659
00:44:52,800 --> 00:44:54,280
Try saying his name,

660
00:44:54,360 --> 00:44:56,280
followed by what you truly feel.

661
00:44:57,200 --> 00:44:58,720
You don't have to do this.

662
00:44:58,800 --> 00:45:00,760
I don't want you to disappear from my life.

663
00:45:11,600 --> 00:45:13,000
I don't know how to do this.

664
00:45:13,800 --> 00:45:15,000
That's okay.

665
00:45:17,360 --> 00:45:18,840
Just follow my lead.

666
00:45:20,480 --> 00:45:21,960
I want you to see me,

667
00:45:23,400 --> 00:45:25,160
not as a younger brother.

668
00:45:27,440 --> 00:45:29,240
I've known you since you were a boy.

669
00:45:30,600 --> 00:45:31,680
So why is my heart

670
00:45:32,640 --> 00:45:35,480
pounding so hard today?

671
00:45:41,800 --> 00:45:43,040
I'm scared.

672
00:45:45,400 --> 00:45:46,840
I'm scared of doing it wrong.

673
00:46:12,120 --> 00:46:13,160
Before,

674
00:46:13,240 --> 00:46:14,920
whenever I was with you,

675
00:46:15,960 --> 00:46:17,360
I felt like I had to do something

676
00:46:18,160 --> 00:46:19,280
or say something

677
00:46:20,320 --> 00:46:22,640
to show you I was trying.

678
00:46:27,480 --> 00:46:28,640
But now

679
00:46:29,720 --> 00:46:30,880
I can just sit here

680
00:46:32,360 --> 00:46:33,520
without trying to do anything,

681
00:46:33,880 --> 00:46:37,120
and still feel happy with you.

682
00:46:56,280 --> 00:46:57,440
Thank you

683
00:46:58,600 --> 00:47:00,440
for deciding to go study abroad.

684
00:47:02,840 --> 00:47:04,480
If you hadn't,

685
00:47:07,120 --> 00:47:08,960
I'd never have learned how to love.

686
00:47:11,680 --> 00:47:14,960
♪ It's too late now ♪

687
00:47:15,040 --> 00:47:21,040
♪ I'm already yours ♪

688
00:47:21,280 --> 00:47:27,160
♪ I'm already yours ♪

689
00:47:28,760 --> 00:47:32,240
♪ Somehow I gave my heart to you ♪

690
00:47:32,560 --> 00:47:38,560
♪ I don't even know when it happened ♪

691
00:47:39,640 --> 00:47:42,840
♪ Someone who's always here ♪

692
00:47:42,920 --> 00:47:47,920
♪ Someone you know so well ♪

693
00:47:48,440 --> 00:47:53,280
♪ There's something I've been waiting to say ♪

694
00:47:53,360 --> 00:47:55,080
For the past 27 years,

695
00:47:55,760 --> 00:47:57,600
I've been confident in everything I do.

696
00:47:58,480 --> 00:48:00,200
I'm still the same person.

697
00:48:00,560 --> 00:48:02,920
I just know myself better now.

698
00:48:03,600 --> 00:48:06,040
I know what I want and who I want in my life.

699
00:48:06,680 --> 00:48:08,040
That's why I'm confident

700
00:48:08,440 --> 00:48:10,240
that Nont will be happy

701
00:48:11,320 --> 00:48:12,600
with this new version of me.

702
00:48:28,200 --> 00:48:30,160
Do you like the person in the mirror?

703
00:48:31,560 --> 00:48:32,560
Of course I do.

704
00:48:33,640 --> 00:48:35,200
Because I don't just see myself.

705
00:48:35,960 --> 00:48:37,200
I see you in there too.

706
00:48:46,080 --> 00:48:47,520
I love this Kit.

707
00:48:50,160 --> 00:48:51,280
I love you too.

708
00:48:52,440 --> 00:48:55,000
The one who waited for me
until I got to know myself.

709
00:49:10,080 --> 00:49:11,080
Kit, hurry!

710
00:49:13,440 --> 00:49:14,520
Kit!

711
00:49:16,280 --> 00:49:17,560
We won't make it!

712
00:49:18,120 --> 00:49:19,760
Come on! I'm going to miss my flight.

713
00:49:19,840 --> 00:49:21,120
You're always late!

714
00:49:23,480 --> 00:49:24,480
Hurry up.

715
00:49:26,680 --> 00:49:27,760
How are you still calm?

716
00:49:27,840 --> 00:49:29,760
What's the rush? We still have four whole hours.

717
00:49:29,840 --> 00:49:32,240
What are you talking about? Look at the time!

718
00:49:34,640 --> 00:49:36,000
Oh, you're right.

719
00:49:36,320 --> 00:49:37,720
I got the time wrong.

720
00:49:37,800 --> 00:49:39,240
We have plenty of time.

721
00:49:39,320 --> 00:49:41,440
Why don't we help each other
stop missing each other?

722
00:49:41,720 --> 00:49:43,160
Right now, I miss you.

723
00:49:47,640 --> 00:49:49,280
I miss you right now too.

724
00:49:55,360 --> 00:49:58,800
♪ I've never believed in love ♪

725
00:49:58,880 --> 00:50:02,200
♪ I've never trusted anyone ♪

726
00:50:02,280 --> 00:50:04,880
♪ I've always lived by reason ♪

727
00:50:04,960 --> 00:50:09,120
♪ I've never followed my heart ♪

728
00:50:09,200 --> 00:50:12,440
♪ Locked away with a complicated code ♪

729
00:50:12,520 --> 00:50:16,880
♪ But you broke through
my heavily guarded firewall ♪

730
00:50:16,960 --> 00:50:21,080
♪ That used to protect my heart ♪

731
00:50:22,040 --> 00:50:25,880
♪ I'm in love with you ♪

732
00:50:25,960 --> 00:50:29,480
♪ I've just realized today that love ♪

733
00:50:29,560 --> 00:50:35,520
♪ Is something I should get to know and explore ♪

734
00:50:35,600 --> 00:50:38,920
♪ The code to my heart has been cracked ♪

735
00:50:39,000 --> 00:50:42,720
♪ By the love you wrapped me in ♪

736
00:50:42,800 --> 00:50:45,680
♪ Having you close puts you in my dreams ♪

737
00:50:45,760 --> 00:50:47,080
♪ You're always on my mind ♪

738
00:50:47,160 --> 00:50:49,760
♪ You cracked my code ♪

739
00:50:49,840 --> 00:50:52,920
♪ My heart's security system is disabled ♪

740
00:50:53,000 --> 00:50:56,080
♪ You unlocked my heart with a love ♪

741
00:50:56,160 --> 00:51:00,760
♪ That this world has never given me ♪

742
00:51:00,840 --> 00:51:03,440
♪ Can I write a new code ♪

743
00:51:03,520 --> 00:51:06,600
♪ That says I love you? ♪

744
00:51:11,840 --> 00:51:15,080
♪ Locked away with a complicated code ♪

745
00:51:15,160 --> 00:51:19,480
♪ But you broke through
my heavily guarded firewall ♪

746
00:51:19,560 --> 00:51:23,680
♪ That used to protect my heart ♪

747
00:51:24,720 --> 00:51:28,480
♪ I'm in love with you ♪

748
00:51:28,560 --> 00:51:32,080
♪ I've just realized today that love ♪

749
00:51:32,160 --> 00:51:38,120
♪ Is something I should get to know and explore ♪

750
00:51:38,200 --> 00:51:41,520
♪ The code to my heart has been cracked ♪

751
00:51:41,600 --> 00:51:45,520
♪ By the love you wrapped me in ♪

752
00:51:45,600 --> 00:51:48,280
♪ Having you close puts you in my dreams ♪

753
00:51:48,360 --> 00:51:49,680
♪ You're always on my mind ♪

754
00:51:49,760 --> 00:51:52,280
♪ You cracked my code ♪

755
00:51:52,360 --> 00:51:55,520
♪ My heart's security system is disabled ♪

756
00:51:55,600 --> 00:51:58,680
♪ You unlocked my heart with a love ♪

757
00:51:58,760 --> 00:52:02,400
♪ That this world has never given me ♪
